/*
OS 05/09/16 - created formula as a part of CR62 part E
OS 12/01/17 - CR96 - correction of tot res grossup
OS 25/01/17 - CR119 - removed substruction of model reserve in line 12, and added
gimla_feff_res_e(t-1) to the calculation
